erDiagram
    accTitle: Accounts and sessions
    accDescr: Each session belongs to exactly one account. An account may have zero or more sessions. The relationship is non-identifying because the session has its own primary key.
    ACCOUNT ||..o{ SESSION : owns
    ACCOUNT {
        int account_id PK
        string display_name
    }
    SESSION {
        int session_id PK
        int account_id FK
    }
